<!--
IGS E2100 games: the software list of machine "e2100" (machines/e2100).

Modelled on MAME's hash/*.xml software lists.  Each <software name="id">
is one dump, run by id: run.sh <id>, igs-loader.exe <id>.  The rom set
<id>/, <id>.7z or <id>.zip on the rompath holds the cabinet's file tree
as the running game sees it; romtool/mkromset.py builds it from the disk
image named in <diskarea>.  docs/IGS_LOADER.md, "Rom sets", describes
every feature; docs/IGS_KEYS.md tabulates the keys.

<disk sha1> is the SHA-1 of the raw disk image (chdman's "data SHA-1").
<dataarea name="files"> lists files of the built set by cabinet path, for
verification (the loaders' verify option; mkromset.py checks them too).
-->
